  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Philippines Promoting Competitiveness and Enhancing Resilience to Natural Disasters Sub-Program 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DPL series aims to support the Government of the Philippines in: i) promoting competitiveness and ii) enhancing resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objectives of the Promoting Competitiveness and Enhancing Resilience to Natural Disasters Sub-Program 3 Development Policy Loan in Philippines are to support the Government of the Philippines in: i) promoting competitiveness; and ii) enhancing resilience. Pillar one, promoting competitiveness: (i) promotes investment in telecommunications; (ii) reduces the cost of doing business; (iii) improves trade facilitation by modernizing customs procedures; and (iv) increases agriculture productivity through regulatory reforms. Pillar two, enhancing resilience: (i) enhances fiscal resilience; (ii) increases social resilience through better digital infrastructure for social program delivery; (iii) increases use of electronic payments through more efficient payment systems; (iv) improves financial risk management to natural disasters and climate change; and (v) strengthens risk management of public assets to natural disasters and climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
